oracle GNU Make 4.4.1
outcome success
file GNUmakefile kept 3
| # With no -f, make looks for GNUmakefile, then makefile, then Makefile, and
| # stops at the first it finds.
| all: ; @printf '%s\n' gnumakefile > out
file Makefile kept 1
| all: ; @printf '%s\n' capital-makefile > out
file out touched 1
| gnumakefile
